# GT Anywhere · 2e Pathway
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the two values.
# .env.local is gitignored. This example file is not -- keep it free of real keys.
#
# Both values come from the Supabase dashboard:
#   Project Settings -> API
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ variables are inlined into the JavaScript bundle at build
# time. The anon key is meant to be public; the row-level security in
# 02-security.sql is what protects student records, not the secrecy of
# this key. Never put the service_role key in a NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR-ANON-PUBLIC-KEY
